<p></p>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYStargetstate-Introduction">Introduction</h1>
<p>As part of MPSYS modernization efforts new application called IDP-Identi=
tyGraph (MOTS # 33944) will be developed based on IDP platform.&nbsp;</p>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYStargetstate-Technologystatck">Technology statck</h1>
<ul>
<li>Spring Boot / Java (IDP Template)</li>
<li>Azure cloud database (Postgres / Cosmos - Evaluating)&nbsp;</li>
<li>Azure Event Hub</li>
<li>Redis Cache</li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYStargetstate-Architecture(Draft)">Architecture (Draft)</h1>
